# `countif` counts the rows where the predicate is true; null counts as false.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize big = countif(amount > 200), none = countif(amount > 1000000), nulls = countif(amount > 0 or isnull(amount))
---- expected
big  | none | nulls
long | long | long
-----+------+------
   3 |    0 |    50
